    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Prerequisite: Level 15, Order of the Mutant</em></p><p>As a Bonus Action, you curse a creature you can see within 30 feet of yourself, giving it the Poisoned condition. The cursed creature repeats a Constitution saving throw at the end of each of its turns, ending the curse on itself on a success.</p><p><strong>Amplify.</strong> The cursed creature takes 4d6 Necrotic damage when you inflict the curse, and it takes this damage again each time it fails a Constitution saving throw to end the curse.</p>",
